Ruby: Do you wanna know the real reason we're not allowed in the forest?
Pepper: Why?
Ruby: Those mountains you see on the horizon, they're said to be home to a big, ferocious wolf!
Ruby: It rules over those mountains, alone, because no other living creature dares to cross its path. 
Ruby: And what's more? It's not just a wolf. It's also been said to take the form of a man!
